sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant WA as Worker - txn A
    participant WB as Worker - txn B
    participant Q as audit_request queue
    participant AU as audit
    participant IX as UNIQUE auditor_id + audit_date

    WA->>Q: claim req-1 - FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED
    WB->>Q: claim req-2 - skips req-1
    Note over WA,WB: both windows contain 2026-10-05;<br/>both see auditor 7 free and least loaded
    WA->>AU: INSERT audit (auditor 7, 2026-10-05)
    WB->>AU: INSERT audit (auditor 7, 2026-10-05)
    AU->>IX: check
    IX-->>WA: OK - row committed
    IX-->>WB: error 23505 - unique_violation
    WB->>WB: catch, move to next candidate (auditor 8)
    WB->>AU: INSERT audit (auditor 8, 2026-10-05)
    AU->>IX: check
    IX-->>WB: OK
    Note over WA,WB: zero double bookings - the database arbitrated, not the code
